# True or myth? Five things everyone has heard
subtitle: "Five things almost everyone has heard, from goldfish memory to radioactive bananas: true or myth? Guess each, then find out why."
tags: ["common myths","biology facts","true or false quiz"]
teaches: ["concepts/myth-busting","vocabulary/animal-biology","methods/critical-thinking"]
voices: {"a":"gemini:Laomedeia | an upbeat, playful quiz host; light and quick","take":"lines"}
format: quiz

## True or myth? Five things everyone has heard
feedback:
    style: warm
    perfect: Nobody fools you.
    good: A sharp eye for a myth.
    poor: These myths fool almost everyone.
    none: The myths won this round.
affirm: playful
sources:
    - id: esb
      title: 'Lightning facts: the Empire State Building'
      authors: US National Weather Service
      year: 2023
      finding: the Empire State Building is struck about 25 times a year
    - id: bed
      title: Banana equivalent dose
      authors: Wikipedia
      year: 2025
      url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Banana_equivalent_dose
      finding: a banana's potassium-40 gives about 15 becquerels; the body keeps its potassium level constant

    sequence claims size 420 items [{"icon":["great wall of china","great wall","castle wall","brick wall","brick"],"label":"Great Wall from space","mark":{"text":"Myth","color":"#b5482e"}},{"icon":{"of":"fish","set":"twemoji"},"label":"3-second memory","mark":{"text":"Myth","color":"#b5482e"}},{"icon":{"of":"cloud with lightning","set":"twemoji"},"label":"Never twice","mark":{"text":"Myth","color":"#b5482e"}},{"icon":{"of":"banana","set":"twemoji"},"label":"Radioactive?","mark":{"text":"True","color":"#2f6b8f"}},{"icon":{"of":"octopus","set":"twemoji"},"label":"Three hearts?","mark":{"text":"True","color":"#2f6b8f"}}] show_upcoming dots hidden true

    card title "True or myth?"

Five things almost everyone has heard. For each one: true, or myth?
    draw claims_dot_1 claims_dot_2 claims_dot_3 claims_dot_4 claims_dot_5 parallel true

First: you can see the Great Wall of China from space.
    draw claims_1

    quiz "The Great Wall can be seen from space with the naked eye. True or myth?" on_canvas true reveal.text "MYTH: too narrow" reveal.at.x 210 reveal.at.y 430 reveal.size 40
        right: Myth. The wall is long but only about as wide as a road, and China's first astronaut, Yang Liwei, could not see it in 2003.
        * True
        + Myth

Next, the goldfish, said to forget everything in three seconds.
    draw claims_2

    quiz "A goldfish's memory lasts only about three seconds. True or myth?" on_canvas true reveal.text "MYTH: months" reveal.at.x 210 reveal.at.y 430 reveal.size 40
        right: Myth. Goldfish remember for months: they learn when food comes, and which sound means dinner.
        * True
        + Myth

Then the old saying that lightning never strikes the same place twice.
    draw claims_3

    quiz "Lightning never strikes the same place twice. True or myth?" on_canvas true reveal.text "MYTH: 25×/yr" reveal.at.x 210 reveal.at.y 430 reveal.size 40
        right: Myth. Tall things get hit again and again: the Empire State Building is struck about twenty-five times a year.
        * True
        + Myth

Now the breakfast table: bananas are said to be radioactive.
    draw claims_4

    quiz "Bananas are radioactive. True or myth?" on_canvas true reveal.text "TRUE: K-40" reveal.at.x 210 reveal.at.y 430 reveal.size 40
        right: True. A tiny share of their potassium is radioactive potassium-40, though your body keeps its potassium level steady, so it does no harm.
        + True
        * Myth

And last, the octopus, said to have three hearts.
    draw claims_5

    quiz "An octopus has three hearts. True or myth?" on_canvas true reveal.text "TRUE: 3 hearts" reveal.at.x 210 reveal.at.y 430 reveal.size 40
        right: True. Two hearts pump blood through the gills, and a third sends it round the body.
        + True
        * Myth

Here are all five together.
    draw claims_strip

And the two that sounded silliest were true.
    highlight claims_4 claims_4_mark claims_5 claims_5_mark effect circle
---
